[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3248.71, "timestamp": "00:54:08", "text": "你已經完成了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3256.63, "timestamp": "00:54:16", "text": "表演了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3259.307, "timestamp": "00:54:19", "text": "哦，他僥倖躲過了我的故障。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3259.67, "timestamp": "00:54:19", "text": "[尖叫聲]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3280.71, "timestamp": "00:54:40", "text": "蜘蛛準備出拳。  持有武器，十分危險。  她浪費了年邁的兄弟。  靈蝶浪費了她的機會。"}]